-001","metadata":{"queue_group":"public_web_customer_portal_changelog_tail","allowed_paths":["apps/shop-suit/**"],"queue_ordinal":5,"payload_sha256":"7af0f8ab35e328d660370915a707ed97bb86afeba1522b0b5db529c025ebf94d","tail_priority_base":160,"tail_sequence_base":1010,"max_implementation_attempts":3},"priority":210,"sequence":1060,"suit_slug":"shop-suit","task_type":"database","created_at":"2026-09-30T22:41:15.786877+00:00","project_id":"f71b3b2b-d56b-4f7e-94f5-0b8c379a1088","risk_level":"critical","updated_at":"2026-10-05T07:39:30.119215+00:00","description":"Extend appointments with customer-facing access credentials. Issue cryptographically random non-sequential human-readable codes; authorized staff can issue/rotate them for existing appointments. Code plus matching normalized phone is required. Successful verification creates only a high-entropy short-lived Shop/customer-scoped session. Rate-limit and audit attempts without logging secrets.","engine_stage":"pending","model_profile":"deep","retry_policy_id":"standard-five","workstream_slug":"shop-suit","verification_plan":["Entropy/format/collision tests.","Code+phone success and mismatch/enumeration tests.","Rate-limit/brute-force, rotate/revoke/session-expiry and cross-Shop replay tests.","Full appointment DB regression."],"acceptance_criteria":["Codes are cryptographically random/non-sequential using a human-friendly alphabet with at least about 50 bits of entropy.","Code alone never returns appointment/customer history; matching normalized phone is required.","Mismatch responses avoid revealing whether code, phone, Shop or customer exists.","Successful verification creates a short-lived token scoped to exactly one Shop and one saved customer or one walk-in appointment.","Codes/sessions can be rotated/revoked and prior access stops working.","Full codes/session secrets never appear in ordinary logs/audit/error text.","Verification is rate-limited at appropriate client/Shop/credential boundaries.","Appointment edits do not silently rotate access credentials.","Appointment without usable phone cannot enable portal access until phone is safely captured or it is linked to a saved customer.","Existing scheduling, availability, idempotency and audit behavior remains intact."]},"after":{"title":"Issue secure appointment access codes and short-lived customer portal sessions","status":"planned","task_id":"SS-WEB-APPT-ACCESS-001","metadata":{"queue_group":"public_web_customer_portal_changelog_tail","allowed_paths":["apps/shop-suit/**","packages/ui/src/templates/","packages/ui/src/types/","packages/ui/tests/","packages/ui/package.json","packages/ux/src/","packages/ux/tests/","packages/ux/package.json","docs/shared/atomic-template-route-inventory.json","docs/shared/ui-ownership-manifest.json"],"queue_ordinal":5,"payload_sha256":"7af0f8ab35e328d660370915a707ed97bb86afeba1522b0b5db529c025ebf94d","tail_priority_base":160,"tail_sequence_base":1010,"max_implementation_attempts":3,"readiness_reconciliation":{"version":1,"base_sha":"3c16c81c3f65d25bcfa82794441b0ee7d2a21588","required_reads":["packages/ui/AGENTS.md","docs/shared/ui-ownership.md"],"pending_operator_inputs":[],"shared_first":true,"protected_scope_approval_required":true,"shared_scope_transition":"exact task_shared_package_offer + authenticated operator scope authority before execution; no grant in this artifact"},"source_allowed_paths":["apps/shop-suit/**","packages/ui/src/templates/","packages/ui/src/types/","packages/ui/tests/","packages/ui/package.json","packages/ux/src/","packages/ux/tests/","packages/ux/package.json","docs/shared/atomic-template-route-inventory.json","docs/shared/ui-ownership-manifest.json"]},"priority":210,"sequence":1060,"suit_slug":"shop-suit","task_type":"database","created_at":"2026-09-30T22:41:15.786877+00:00","project_id":"f71b3b2b-d56b-4f7e-94f5-0b8c379a1088","risk_level":"critical","updated_at":"2026-10-05T07:39:30.119215+00:00","description":"Extend appointments with customer-facing access crede