31:34.660404+00:00","description":"OBJECTIVE: Implement Shop Dashboard as the first complete product pilot of the approved UI PRO methodology and shared patterns.\n\nUSER / PROBLEM: Shop Dashboard contains rich operational data but too many blocks/card-like surfaces receive similar visual treatment, reducing hierarchy.\n\nCURRENT-STATE EVIDENCE: Inspect the real dashboard, report permissions, trial/setup states, branch filters, reports, drill-through routes, loading/denied/error states and calculations. Preserve all functional behavior.\n\nREFERENCE-PATTERN EVIDENCE: Research operational-summary hierarchy, location/date filtering, exceptions and source drill-through using one strong general operational dashboard and one relevant POS/shop-domain reference.\n\nBUILDING SUIT ADAPTATION: Apply Building Suit shell/archetypes/metric/table/form patterns. Prioritize a small set of primary metrics, meaningful exceptions/actions and records. Preserve Shop data, permissions, calculations, subscription/setup behavior and bilingual content.\n\nRead root/scoped AGENTS.md, packages/ui/AGENTS.md, docs/shared/ui-ownership.md and docs/shared/atomic-template-route-inventory.json. All presentation, including product-specific screens, belongs in packages/ui; reusable interaction controllers belong in packages/ux. Suits retain business/data/permission logic, typed content/props and semantic commands. Consume one registered complete page template; do not compose local UI. Preserve Solo catalogue/pricing periods, dashboard navigation, shared tabs/card spans and responsive behavior from PR #248.","engine_stage":"pending","model_profile":"deep","retry_policy_id":"deep-only","workstream_slug":"shop-suit","verification_plan":[{"version":2,"kind":"external_gate","description":"Record references/pattern decisions and Building Suit adaptation.","required":true,"phase":"pre_publication","blocker":"bs-ui-pro-006-evidence-1-required"},{"version":2,"kind":"external_gate","description":"Capture before/after screenshots using the same realistic fixture where possible.","required":true,"phase":"pre_publication","blocker":"bs-ui-pro-006-evidence-2-required"},{"version":2,"kind":"planned_test","description":"Exercise filters, drill-through, owner/employee access and state variations.","commands":["bs-ui-pro-006-obligation-3"],"required":true,"expected_outputs":["apps/shop-suit/tests/unit/bs-ui-pro-006-obligation-3.test.mjs"]},{"version":2,"kind":"group","description":"Run Shop/app/shared checks appropriate to changed paths and git diff --check.","commands":["readiness-all-consumer-quality","readiness-workspace-tests","workspace-check","git-diff-check"],"requires":[]}],"acceptance_criteria":["Rendered Shop Dashboard follows the quiet premium operational language and no longer reads as a wall of equivalent cards.","Primary metrics, filters, exceptions, detail sections and source drill-through have deliberate hierarchy.","All report calculations, permissions, routes, setup/trial/subscription behavior and backend semantics remain unchanged.","Before/after evidence covers desktop/mobile, EN/AR, LTR/RTL, light/dark and relevant states.","Pilot produces an explicit visual handback suitable for operator approval before propagation."]}},{"task_id":"BS-UI-PRO-008","before":{"title":"Propagate approved UI PRO patterns across remaining Shop workflows","status":"planned","task_id":"BS-UI-PRO-008","metadata":{"initiative":"building-suit-ui-professionalization","preparation":{"required_reads":["AGENTS.md","docs/shared/ui-pro-task-guide.md","docs/shared/design-system.md","docs/shared/ui-ownership.md","docs/shared/interactions.md","docs/shared/data-table.md","packages/ui/AGENTS.md","packages/design-tokens/tokens.json"],"pilot_before_propagation":true,"rendered_visual_review_required":true},"queue_anchor":{"assigned_priority":340,"first_ui_sequence":2610,"previous_max_priority":240,"previous_max_sequence":2600},"queue_policy":"last-after-existing-tasks-at-registration","allowed_paths